spec SavedPlans.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK CreateAllocationsUnique CommitRequiresCurrentRevision RejectedWritesPreserveStore CommitChangesOnlyTarget CommitReflectsOperation DraftIsolation ReadsReflectStore
reach ConcurrentCreates | two tabs two ids
reach TwoRecordsStored | two tabs two ids
reach EditedOneOfTwo | two tabs two ids
reach StaleEditRejected | two tabs one id
reach StaleDeleteRejected | two tabs one id
reach MissingEditRejected | two tabs one id
reach MissingDeleteRejected | two tabs one id
reach AbortedEdit | one tab
reach IndependentDrafts | two tabs one id
run one tab | Tabs=1 Ids=1 Budget=2
run two tabs one id | Tabs=2 Ids=1 Budget=3
run two tabs two ids | Tabs=2 Ids=2 Budget=3
